{
  "$comment": "The shared corpus for the artifact contract schema. Read by storyArtifactContract.test.ts and by contractValidatorParity.test.ts, which runs the TypeScript and the publisher's CommonJS implementation over every case and fails if they disagree. A case with no `artifacts` key is the ABSENT case: undefined, which is accepted with zero artifacts. `expect_codes` is the sorted set of refusal codes; an empty array means the contract is accepted.",
